WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.183
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Good evening… Oh, you're still awake.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.273
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：The snow sounded so pretty… so I came to play.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.203
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：I'm Koyuki. A snow spirit.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.870
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Hey… can I borrow this ear for a moment?

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.250
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuuu…)

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.927
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Hehe… was that cold?

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.145
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Then… guess which side I'll come from next.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.470
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：…This side.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.750
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuu…)

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.064
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Ehehe, now the left!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.350
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuu…)

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.161
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Right… or so you thought…

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.850
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：…Left.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.850
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuuu…)

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.350
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Fufufu.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.378
<v Homura>Homura：Hey, hey! Not fair, Koyuki gets all the fun!

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.750
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Eek!?

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.368
<v Homura>Homura：Okay, okay, scoot over a little~

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:02.110
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：H-Homura… don't push me…

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:06.347
<v Homura>Homura：Nice to meet you. I'm Homura, a foxfire spirit.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.348
<v Homura>Homura：See… nice and warm, right?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.650
<v Homura>Homura：(haaa…)

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.750
<v Homura>Homura：Nihihi.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.991
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：C-cool feels nicer, right…?

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.495
<v Homura>Homura：Nope, warm is obviously better!

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.850
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuuu…)

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.850
<v Homura>Homura：(haaa…)

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.827
<v Homura>Homura：Then let's switch! I get the left this time!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.352
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：This side's… nice and cool too.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.650
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuu…)

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.692
<v Homura>Homura：And this side's toasty~

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.950
<v Homura>Homura：(haa…)

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.126
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Hmph… I won't lose.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.184
<v Homura>Homura：Heh, it's a contest then!

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:36.858
<v Homura>Homura：Get back here!

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.905
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Eek! Don't chase me~!

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:40.950
<v Homura>Homura：I'm gonna catch you~!

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:45.618
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Ahaha! Over here, over here~!

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.350
<v Homura>Homura：(haa!)

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.950
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuu!)

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:49.496
<v Homura>Homura：Ugh, you're so quick!

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.450
<v Homura>Homura：(haa!)

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.150
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuu!)

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.337
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Over here~!

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:56.111
<v Homura>Homura：Ah, there you are!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.650
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(pant… pant…)

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.296
<v Homura>Homura：Gotcha~! …Just kidding.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:06.002
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Geez… hehe, that was fun.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.734
<v Homura>Homura：Hey Koyuki, shall we do it together?

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.892
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：…Okay. Ready…

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.209
<v Koyuki & Homura>Koyuki & Homura：Our secret magic of snow and flame!

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.571
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Wow… so pretty…

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.950
<v Homura>Homura：Right~?

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:25.404
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Thank you… for playing with us tonight.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.308
<v Homura>Homura：Let's play again sometime.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.116
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：Good night…

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.850
<v Koyuki>Koyuki：(fuu…)

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.250
<v Homura>Homura：Night-night~

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.050
<v Homura>Homura：(haa…)
